<title>SPAIN: Spain's May jobless falls to 13.26 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's May jobless falls to 13.26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	   MAY 97	APRIL 97    MAY 96</p>
<p> Total (million)	 2.12	   2.18	 2.27</p>
<p> Change on month     -57,866	-45,799	-67,574</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	13.26	  13.61	 14.36</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
